  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato into bite-sized chunks and place on the lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil. Season with salt.\n• Toss to coat, then spread out evenly and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63071feabf9eb4837c055611/step-0ac7e2b4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate carrot and zucchini. Drain sweetcorn. Squeeze excess moisture out of carrot and zucchini using a paper towel or clean cloth.\n• In a medium bowl, combine carrot, zucchini, sweetcorn, Cheddar cheese, plain flour, egg, milk, vegetable stock powder and all purpose seasoning. Lift out some of the mixture with a spoon, if it's too wet and doesn't hold its shape, add more flour.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63071feabf9eb4837c055611/step-d42758e6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• When oil is hot, cook fritters in batches, flattening each with a spatula, until golden, 3-4 minutes each side. Don't flip the fritters too early to ensure they have time to set.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63071feabf9eb4837c055611/step-ec430aad.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop cucumber. Combine cucumber, spinach and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil in a medium bowl. Toss to coat and season.\n• In a small bowl, combine mayonnaise and sweet chilli sauce.\n• Divide the fritters, potato and salad between plates.\n• Serve with sweet chilli mayo.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63071feabf9eb4837c055611/step-e93c3542.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
